 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Can do something",
   "texto": [
    "Add **-(y)abilir/-ebilir** to the root of the verb and then personal termination: **gidebilirim** = I can go, **gidebilir misin?** = can you go?",
    "The vowel of termination depends on harmony. In daily use, **-abilir miyim?** also serves to ask for permission: «Can I?»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Transport",
   "texto": [
    "**Otobüs** = bus; **metro** = metro; **tren** = train; **taksi** = taxi. **İle** means «with / in» and goes after the name: **otobüsle** = by bus.",
    "**Bilet** = ticket; **durak** = stop. **Saat kaçta?** asks what time."
   ]
  },
